**/*
!.gitignore

!README.md
!LICENSE

# instance.json contains metadata about the mod pack, used with AT Launcher
# We exclude this because this contains information about the system, which is
# not relevant to the mod pack.
instance.json

# In stead, we would include the contents of an exported *.mrpack. 
# Namely, the modrinth.index.json.
# However, because the contents of this file are auto-generated 
# during export, we do not include it in the repository. In stead,
# we use the Releases tab to upload the mod pack with these details.
modrinth.index.json

# To keep track of the mod pack's metadata, however, we should include 
# an index.json based on some of the contents of instance.json or 
# modrinth.index.json.
!index.json

# The config folder isn't actually used in the final mod pack, but it's
# useful to include with VCS, to keep track of in-game changes.
!config
!config/**/*

!overrides
!overrides/**/*

!server-overrides
!server-overrides/**/*

!client-overrides
!client-overrides/**/*